00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:53.953
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shiteru

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:58.390
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shiteru

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:02.629
Doushite nano?

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:06.599
Konna ureshikute

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:14.404
Chigiresouna hodo waratte iru noni

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:22.949
Kare no senaka mite wa mune tsumaru

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:30.913
Taenai egao no utsu no naka de

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.225
Mr. Forrest?

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.298
Mr. Forrest...

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:40.133
I've heard that he was brought here.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.068
How is he doing?
What's going on with him right now?

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.336
Are you a family member?

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.138
Like I said, I'm his sister!

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:46.105
Oh...

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.903
He's all right. He's really lucky.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.905
The surgery went well.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:54.506
Thank you so much.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:01.187
Episode #16
Painful Lie

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.889
What the hell is he doing?
Episode #16
Painful Lie

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.314
What took you so long, Dad?!

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:08.017
You do this all the time, all the time!

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:12.499
They said Randy rushed into the street and got
hit by a car! They think he tried to kill himself!

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:13.600
They told me that too.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.169
Hey, this is just like what happened to Mom!

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.570
The same thing again!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.439
What have you been doing until now?!

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:20.940
I can't believe you took this long!

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.271
I'm sorry, Claire.

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:23.676
I was out of town and just came
back a little while ago.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:28.648
You see, Randy was depending on you!
So, how could you...

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:29.048
It was a very important business and
I just couldn't drop it and leave...

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.316
Who do you think you are showing up so late?!
It was a very important business and
I just couldn't drop it and leave...

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.283
Who do you think you are showing up so late?!

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:33.620
All you ever do is work, work, work!

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.456
You're always sure to disappear
whenever we have any problems!

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.658
Claire, I never meant to...

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:43.096
Mom couldn't handle the stress
from everything and lost it!

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.564
Because you never did anything for us!

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.131
Your mother was always on my mind, too!

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:46.166
Mom, and Randy...
Your mother was always on my mind, too!

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:47.133
Your mother was always on my mind, too!

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.134
I was worried about her, too!

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:51.271
Stop lying! You didn't do a thing for them!

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:52.972
You never paid them any attention!

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:54.307
Claire...

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.242
It's just the same thing over and over...
Claire, I've been in touch with
the hospital the whole time.

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:56.609
Claire, I've been in touch with
the hospital the whole time.

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:57.343
And now Randy almost died just like Mom!

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.012
There's an excellent doctor at this
hospital whom I've known a long time...
And now Randy almost died just like Mom!

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.013
There's an excellent doctor at this
hospital whom I've known a long time...

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:00.180
It's the same thing!

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.247
I asked him to take care of Randy!
It's the same thing!

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:01.581
I asked him to take care of Randy!

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:04.117
You always let things go until
something has already happened!

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.818
You were just too late with Mom.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.020
But I always called her from where I was...

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:07.887
In the end you always try to
solve problems with money.
But I always called her from where I was...

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:09.289
In the end you always try to
solve problems with money.

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:10.056
Claire!

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:10.290
Much easier than running all
over town in a panic like me!
Claire!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.025
Much easier than running all
over town in a panic like me!

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:12.959
Claire!

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:14.327
All you had to do is call this "excellent" doctor!

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:14.994
Claire, listen to me! It's not like that!
All you had to do is call this "excellent" doctor!

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:16.062
Claire, listen to me! It's not like that!

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:17.363
That's how it is!

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:17.931
It's all I could do at the time!

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:18.965
I'm saying it doesn't matter
when it's already too late!
It's all I could do at the time!

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:21.365
I'm saying it doesn't matter
when it's already too late!

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:26.072
You don't give a damn about your family,
do you? We're the pain in the ass, right?

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:27.807
How could you say such a thing?

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:30.503
I'm sure it's a real pain to
take the time now to talk to me.

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:33.213
Claire, you're the one who's
avoided me all this time!

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.348
You walked out on us first.

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.816
You ran away from home!

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:39.152
It's not like you were ever there anyway!

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:40.954
It didn't matter to you if I was at home or not!

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.055
It DID matter!

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:42.789
Don't lie to me.

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:43.056
I tried to call you so many times...
Don't lie to me.

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:44.057
I tried to call you so many times...

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:44.891
It's because you hated me!

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:46.593
...but you were never there to answer!
It's because you hated me!

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:47.093
Claire!

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:47.594
Don't touch me!
Claire!

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:48.492
Don't touch me!

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:51.155
I hate you so much!

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:55.134
But Randy was always depending on you!

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:55.802
Like I said, I was trying to...

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:56.536
He waited and waited for you!
Like I said, I was trying to...

00:03:56.536 --> 00:03:57.525
He waited and waited for you!

00:03:58.271 --> 00:04:00.466
If you're not going to do anything for us,
then just leave us alone!

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:04.838
Don't just give us money or pretend
you'll do something to help!

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:06.936
Claire!

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:12.809
Emma, it's almost time.

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:16.586
Sorry! I woke up early for nothing!

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:19.025
What do you think?

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:19.892
You look beautiful.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:20.859
Really?

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:27.362
Kate, I'll be home a little late tonight.

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:29.168
We're leaving now.

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:30.336
See you later!

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:31.428
Later!

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:37.408
So, you didn't get any sleep?

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:39.044
No...

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:43.241
So, you let your dad have it, huh?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.339
Yeah...

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:47.647
But I don't regret that.

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:50.857
I'll go get some sleep now.

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:52.051
Thanks for helping with the car.

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:53.684
Hey!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:59.022
Maybe it's a good idea to talk your dad again.

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:01.263
No need for that.

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:06.506
I have to go to my locker.

00:05:06.506 --> 00:05:08.408
Huh? But class is gonna start soon.

00:05:08.408 --> 00:05:09.670
I forgot something.

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:12.578
It's math class, right?
I thought it was science class.

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:13.413
Dude!

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:14.914
Sorry, you can go on ahead.

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:16.040
All right!

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:18.885
What's up?

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.375
What is it that you wanted to talk to me about?

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:22.816
About last night.

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:24.457
Last night?

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:29.861
Last night, you were with the literature
instructor Nick, weren't you?

00:05:31.597 --> 00:05:32.699
What was that about?

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:34.467
That was just...

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:35.668
Since when?

00:05:35.668 --> 00:05:37.537
What have you guys been doing,
meeting up at night like that?

00:05:37.537 --> 00:05:39.639
What? We were just talking!

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:40.973
At night? After school?

00:05:40.973 --> 00:05:46.479
I've noticed that you stopped hanging out
with us lately, but that's how it is, huh?

00:05:46.479 --> 00:05:49.949
What do you mean by that?
Will you stop assuming things?!

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:54.113
Rachel, I know you've been hiding
something from me.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.755
What?

00:05:55.755 --> 00:05:59.452
I've been waiting for you forever,
telling myself to wait for the right time for us.

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:02.417
I've always wanted to ask, but I didn't,
and chose to wait for you instead!

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:05.256
But you aren't going to tell me anything at all!

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:09.836
Just what is it? Something you can't
tell me but you can tell him?

00:06:09.836 --> 00:06:11.971
What? What are you talking about?

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:16.067
Don't you play dumb!
What the hell are you hiding from me?

00:06:16.776 --> 00:06:19.445
You wouldn't share it with me,
but you'd ask for his advice?

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:21.047
Luke, it's not like that...

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:21.781
Tell me why he's okay, but I'm not!
Luke, it's not like that...

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:23.916
Tell me why he's okay, but I'm not!

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.850
That's not how it is!

00:06:26.219 --> 00:06:28.050
Then will you talk to me too?

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:31.290
Come on, tell me what's going
on with you, right now!

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:34.157
Luke, nothing's going on.

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:37.930
You just won't tell me, huh?

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.065
Luke!

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:42.432
Go ahead and hang out with the guy that
you can share everything with!

00:06:42.969 --> 00:06:44.904
Go ahead and be with him! Spend nights
with him and tell him all your problems!

00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:47.896
I can't tell anyone the truth about this!

00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:49.732
What?

00:06:51.477 --> 00:06:53.411
So, you do have something
that you can't tell me.

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:56.182
Luke...

00:06:56.182 --> 00:06:59.811
What is it, Rachel? What are you talking about?

00:07:00.653 --> 00:07:02.621
Come on, Rachel!

00:07:04.123 --> 00:07:06.353
Is it something you can never share with me?

00:07:07.059 --> 00:07:09.152
Tell me, Rachel.

00:07:13.299 --> 00:07:15.426
I'm sorry, Luke.

00:07:16.769 --> 00:07:18.259
I can't tell you.

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:24.404
Fine...

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:26.271
Luke?

00:07:26.913 --> 00:07:29.404
Let's just stop seeing each other.

00:07:30.683 --> 00:07:32.651
You do whatever the hell you want.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.312
Luke!

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:43.853
Kate!

00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:45.958
Oh, Jessica...

00:07:46.899 --> 00:07:48.457
I need to talk to you for a sec.

00:07:50.736 --> 00:07:54.604
Jessica, class is about to start.

00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:59.569
Well, what I want to talk to you about today
isn't about Grace or anything like that.

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:01.973
It's a private matter.

00:08:02.682 --> 00:08:03.842
Okay...

00:08:04.884 --> 00:08:09.685
I have been looking into things about you.

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:10.823
Huh?

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:15.453
You, Claire, Rachel and Rose...

00:08:16.963 --> 00:08:19.693
Then I noticed something as I was
checking on things about you.

00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:22.802
When it comes to untidiness like being absent or
late for school and leaving school early,

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:26.329
surprisingly all four of you seem to have
done them on the same days.

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:28.740
So, I thought something is up.

00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:32.578
Is it possible that you guys have been
involved in some kind of trouble

00:08:32.578 --> 00:08:34.146
that you can't tell the school
about by any chance?

00:08:34.146 --> 00:08:36.979
I'm not asking you this question
as a member of Grace.

00:08:37.683 --> 00:08:41.449
I'm just asking, because personally,
I'm worried about you guys.

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:43.185
Jessica...

00:08:43.656 --> 00:08:48.855
Is the truth that maybe you guys
have been blackmailed?

00:08:50.096 --> 00:08:51.731
Blackmailed?

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:58.569
For example, let's say, some guy knows your
weakness so he's been blackmailing you.

00:08:58.905 --> 00:09:02.108
And he's been threatening to expose you,
so you've had to let him...

00:09:02.108 --> 00:09:03.097
What?

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:06.812
I won't tell anyone, so you can talk to me
if you're troubled with something.

00:09:06.812 --> 00:09:08.939
There might be something I could
do to help you too.

00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:13.810
Kate?

00:09:16.889 --> 00:09:21.460
Thank you, Jessica. It's okay,
nothing like that is happening.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:22.828
But it is strange!

00:09:22.828 --> 00:09:27.099
This is hard to admit, but the truth is
that we kind of hit it off

00:09:27.099 --> 00:09:29.101
as I was warning them as a member of Grace.

00:09:29.101 --> 00:09:30.603
Really?

00:09:30.603 --> 00:09:34.232
Maybe I wanted to become a
girl like them in a way.

00:09:35.675 --> 00:09:39.611
I'm sorry, Jessica. I guess I'm no good, huh?

00:09:40.313 --> 00:09:41.507
Kate...

00:09:42.114 --> 00:09:45.083
Thank you for worrying about me, Jessica.

00:09:46.719 --> 00:09:48.209
I really appreciate it.

00:09:49.322 --> 00:09:50.482
Let's go to class.

00:09:52.024 --> 00:09:53.389
Okay...

00:09:54.994 --> 00:09:56.689
Sorry, you can go ahead.

00:09:57.196 --> 00:09:58.264
Hello?

00:09:58.264 --> 00:09:59.322
Hi.

00:10:02.201 --> 00:10:03.202
Yes...

00:10:03.202 --> 00:10:05.102
Can I see you tonight just for a little while?

00:10:05.705 --> 00:10:07.468
I'm going to tell you something really cool.

00:10:15.114 --> 00:10:16.445
Herve...

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:19.641
Hey, did I wake you?

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.255
Is something wrong?

00:10:23.255 --> 00:10:25.815
No, it's nothing.

00:10:26.792 --> 00:10:28.589
Do you wanna eat something? I'll bring it.

00:10:29.028 --> 00:10:31.553
No, I don't want anything.

00:10:32.932 --> 00:10:34.126
Okay...

00:10:34.867 --> 00:10:37.028
You're sure it's here?

00:10:37.737 --> 00:10:39.102
Yeah...

00:10:43.676 --> 00:10:45.303
Maybe he's out.

00:10:46.012 --> 00:10:49.072
This place is scary.
Let's come back some other time.

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:50.675
Okay...

00:10:58.824 --> 00:11:00.052
Rose!

00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:01.721
Dad...

00:11:03.629 --> 00:11:05.028
Dad!

00:11:09.568 --> 00:11:12.332
Dad... Dad...

00:11:16.809 --> 00:11:18.709
I'm amazed that you found me.

00:11:20.413 --> 00:11:22.973
It must have been very difficult to find me.

00:11:24.617 --> 00:11:26.175
How's everybody?

00:11:27.019 --> 00:11:28.287
How are Paul and Carrie?

00:11:28.287 --> 00:11:31.017
Yeah, they talk about you all the time.

00:11:31.457 --> 00:11:35.461
Carrie is still holding onto that doll
you bought her before.

00:11:35.461 --> 00:11:37.830
Oh, what's that thing called? Wendy...

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:38.664
That's right, Wendy!

00:11:38.664 --> 00:11:40.222
Oh yeah, this is it!

00:11:40.599 --> 00:11:43.193
Carrie always goes to sleep with the big one.

00:11:43.869 --> 00:11:45.996
So, she still has it.

00:11:46.505 --> 00:11:47.529
Yeah...

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:53.276
I really feel that I've done such a
terrible thing to all of you.

00:11:53.779 --> 00:11:57.510
All of the sudden, things got ugly at my job.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:03.850
I didn't want to make your mother and you guys
suffer more than you already had, so I left home.

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:09.520
You know Paul and Carrie would be much
happier if you stayed with us.

00:12:10.329 --> 00:12:15.562
I'd be much happier if you lived
with us while you worked too!

00:12:16.702 --> 00:12:24.131
Dad, don't think you'll trouble us.
So, start working from home again, Dad.

00:12:24.643 --> 00:12:27.373
But I can't do that right now.

00:12:28.047 --> 00:12:29.947
Give me a little more time.

00:12:30.282 --> 00:12:33.012
I still have to pay off a debt.

00:12:33.686 --> 00:12:34.920
Dad...

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.320
I'm really sorry.

00:12:37.957 --> 00:12:39.254
Dad...

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:45.797
Dad, after you left Mom collapsed.

00:12:46.198 --> 00:12:47.358
What?

00:12:47.833 --> 00:12:50.028
Her old illness came back.

00:12:50.803 --> 00:12:55.263
She won't say anything, but I think she's waiting
for you, believing that you'll come back.

00:12:56.809 --> 00:13:02.076
We'll be waiting too,
believing that you'll come back.

00:13:03.082 --> 00:13:06.518
So, come home soon.

00:13:08.287 --> 00:13:09.555
These are...

00:13:09.555 --> 00:13:13.514
Evidence from the cases of those girls who
committed suicide, and the pictures in question.

00:13:14.226 --> 00:13:19.465
I did my best trying to collect the most recent
ones from the day that they died.

00:13:19.465 --> 00:13:20.966
This many?

00:13:20.966 --> 00:13:25.869
We don't know if that pharmaceutical company
has any involvement with them just yet, but...

00:13:26.205 --> 00:13:28.374
Someone out there is involved.

00:13:28.374 --> 00:13:29.705
What do you mean by that?

00:13:30.009 --> 00:13:32.411
In the picture which was taken a week before
her death, she had pierced ears,

00:13:32.411 --> 00:13:33.810
but her dead body didn't.

00:13:34.046 --> 00:13:37.641
Her hair was short, but three days
later her hair was 20 cm longer.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:41.620
The pictures with dead bodies were actually
older than the other pictures.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:45.283
Which indicates that they were actually
alive even after their deaths.

00:13:46.625 --> 00:13:50.857
So, are you telling me that these girls
in the pictures are ghosts?!

00:13:51.397 --> 00:13:52.694
Maybe...

00:13:52.932 --> 00:13:54.399
There's no way!

00:13:54.633 --> 00:13:57.033
That is why we're going to investigate them.

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:01.301
That pharmaceutical company, we're going
to investigate them thoroughly.

00:14:07.513 --> 00:14:08.707
Excuse me.

00:14:14.019 --> 00:14:15.020
Hello?

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:17.318
Hey, Emilio. It's me.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:22.261
I'm about to go see Kate. I'm sorry, but most
likely it will cause you some trouble,

00:14:22.261 --> 00:14:23.395
so I just wanted to warn you ahead of time.

00:14:23.395 --> 00:14:26.031
Herve, what do you mean by that?

00:14:26.031 --> 00:14:27.166
Herve!

00:14:27.166 --> 00:14:29.969
Who'd have thought that the enemy has
been brazenly dealing with Kate

00:14:29.969 --> 00:14:31.237
face-to-face all this time, huh?

00:14:31.237 --> 00:14:34.573
Right, once the place is
confirmed call me again.

00:14:34.573 --> 00:14:37.940
Listen, don't do anything on your own.
Wait for me to get there.

00:14:39.178 --> 00:14:40.813
How careless of us!

00:14:40.813 --> 00:14:47.150
Okay, I got it. I'll send the backup right now.
Stand by until they get there.

00:14:47.853 --> 00:14:49.488
I'll go too.

00:14:49.488 --> 00:14:54.323
First they got Lise, and now this.
The Dolore might be serious this time.

00:14:58.197 --> 00:15:01.189
Hi, I'm gonna get right to the point, okay?

00:15:02.134 --> 00:15:03.269
Okay...

00:15:03.269 --> 00:15:06.466
Does someone order you to do stuff like that?

00:15:07.873 --> 00:15:09.568
Or you do it because you want to?

00:15:10.109 --> 00:15:11.371
No.

00:15:12.044 --> 00:15:14.512
Why do you ask me that?

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.110
You...

00:15:20.786 --> 00:15:22.344
You...

00:15:23.122 --> 00:15:26.751
Are you the enemy?

00:15:29.128 --> 00:15:30.362
You are...

00:15:30.362 --> 00:15:31.522
That's right.

00:15:32.298 --> 00:15:34.466
You knew about this from the beginning?!

00:15:34.466 --> 00:15:36.669
Have you been seeing me so you can use me?!

00:15:36.669 --> 00:15:37.303
That's right.

00:15:37.303 --> 00:15:38.395
That's horrible!
That's right.

00:15:39.772 --> 00:15:41.000
Just horrible...

00:15:43.309 --> 00:15:46.245
Emilio... Is this the case with Emilio too?!

00:15:46.245 --> 00:15:48.179
You might wanna ask him that question directly.

00:15:48.948 --> 00:15:49.949
No way...

00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:53.752
But you know what? You still haven't
discovered the more important things.

00:15:53.752 --> 00:15:56.550
You've been deceived by those women also.

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:01.726
They've been purposefully hiding the
most important things from you.

00:16:02.227 --> 00:16:04.957
Do you know what it means for
you guys to win this?

00:16:05.264 --> 00:16:06.265
No, I don't.

00:16:06.265 --> 00:16:10.102
You've been fighting for something much
bigger that stands behind you.

00:16:10.102 --> 00:16:11.170
That's because you guys are...

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:13.138
That's not true, it's not us.

00:16:13.138 --> 00:16:14.765
It's something that's a lot bigger than that.

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:19.975
They have been making you fight all this time in
order to steal a book of curses back from us.

00:16:20.412 --> 00:16:22.047
They've been making us?!

00:16:22.047 --> 00:16:24.845
Exactly, you've been fighting on behalf of them.

00:16:25.084 --> 00:16:29.214
It's in the west 26th block, at the dock by the river!
Hurry! Kate is in danger!

00:16:30.055 --> 00:16:35.925
Our predecessors were cursed to turn into beasts
for stealing one book of curses from them.

00:16:36.362 --> 00:16:38.330
The same curse has been passed down to us.

00:16:38.764 --> 00:16:41.033
You can't do anything with only
one book of curses,

00:16:41.033 --> 00:16:44.230
but when you have two of them you
can finally remove the curse.

00:16:45.337 --> 00:16:48.465
Each side in this conflict has been fighting
to steal the book the other side has.

00:16:48.907 --> 00:16:51.102
The one who steals the book
from the other side wins.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.113
You guys have been killing our
people for that purpose!

00:16:54.113 --> 00:16:56.843
But they told us that they'll
never go back to normal!

00:16:57.149 --> 00:16:58.951
That's why doing what we do is
the only solution, they said!

00:16:58.951 --> 00:17:01.854
Besides I just wanna be resurrected, that's all!

00:17:01.854 --> 00:17:03.014
"Resurrected"?

00:17:04.056 --> 00:17:06.115
That's why I told you that they've
been deceiving you!

00:17:07.326 --> 00:17:12.264
It doesn't matter who wins; you girls will never go
back to your old bodies and be resurrected.

00:17:12.264 --> 00:17:13.399
That's a lie!

00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:14.500
I'm telling you the truth!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:17.403
If you lose to us, obviously you're
done for right then and there.

00:17:17.403 --> 00:17:18.836
You will die.

00:17:19.238 --> 00:17:23.742
But even if you win, the moment those
two books are combined,

00:17:23.742 --> 00:17:25.911
you'll lose all the memories you've ever had.

00:17:25.911 --> 00:17:27.413
That's enough of your lies!

00:17:27.413 --> 00:17:28.647
I'm not lying!

00:17:28.647 --> 00:17:31.650
You will not be the same people.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.853
And you will stay in these bodies
and never age, eternally.

00:17:34.853 --> 00:17:37.956
I will never believe that!

00:17:37.956 --> 00:17:41.493
Even if you win, you'll have to forget about the life
that you have now, your family and friends!

00:17:41.493 --> 00:17:45.327
I won't believe anything you say! You're a liar!

00:17:50.069 --> 00:17:51.970
Do you wanna die right now?

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:55.541
Or you wanna abandon everything you have,
and live and suffer forever?

00:17:55.541 --> 00:17:56.508
Let me go!

00:17:56.508 --> 00:18:00.045
My cousin Mireille is dead and
she was only twelve!

00:18:00.045 --> 00:18:01.080
Because of the curse that they put on us!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.748
I don't know anything about that!
Because of the curse that they put on us!

00:18:02.748 --> 00:18:07.352
At this rate, my sister Anna will become
their victim very soon!

00:18:07.352 --> 00:18:10.480
I must win for Anna no matter what!

00:18:12.024 --> 00:18:13.321
I'm sorry...

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.498
You finally showed up!

00:18:29.808 --> 00:18:35.080
To think a Dolore before manifestation
would show up before us like this...

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.381
He must be suicidal.

00:18:36.381 --> 00:18:37.216
Let's see about that!

00:18:37.216 --> 00:18:39.514
Lula, take Kate and JC!

00:18:42.054 --> 00:18:43.681
You're just a man who hasn't even manifested!

00:18:46.625 --> 00:18:47.751
Damn you!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.184
Die!

00:18:54.666 --> 00:18:57.760
We can defeat you and those that
have been affected too!

00:18:58.804 --> 00:19:00.101
Damn!

00:19:09.047 --> 00:19:10.182
Emilio!

00:19:10.182 --> 00:19:11.350
Emilio?!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.351
Kate...

00:19:12.351 --> 00:19:13.716
We're gonna destroy them!

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:16.688
She is...

00:19:16.688 --> 00:19:18.622
the school president!

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:20.655
School? You mean, Kate's?

00:19:21.393 --> 00:19:22.427
This is terrible!

00:19:22.427 --> 00:19:25.396
Let's go! Knowing where they are
will give us the advantage!

00:19:27.699 --> 00:19:28.300
Lula!

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:28.700
Don't do it!
Lula!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:29.462
Don't do it!

00:19:35.908 --> 00:19:37.205
You damn bitch!

00:19:39.611 --> 00:19:40.245
Lula!

00:19:40.245 --> 00:19:40.846
No! Stay back!
Lula!

00:19:40.846 --> 00:19:41.744
No! Stay back!

00:19:58.664 --> 00:20:00.499
Humans are weak creatures, aren't they?

00:20:00.499 --> 00:20:01.761
Frickin' beast!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.829
That's what the Animus turned us into!

00:20:05.604 --> 00:20:07.629
How do you like being inferior to a beast?

00:20:08.473 --> 00:20:11.271
Helping the Animus won't get you anywhere!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:14.479
The bottom line is that you just a pathetic
beast that's bound to perish!

00:20:14.479 --> 00:20:15.776
You peasant!

00:20:16.315 --> 00:20:17.577
JC!

00:20:27.125 --> 00:20:28.126
Herve!

00:20:28.126 --> 00:20:29.388
All right!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.564
Don't you go!

00:20:34.099 --> 00:20:36.124
JC! JC!

00:20:36.468 --> 00:20:38.959
He got me, Sis.

00:20:39.738 --> 00:20:41.006
Sis?

00:20:41.006 --> 00:20:42.674
I won't make it.

00:20:42.674 --> 00:20:43.175
I won't make it.
Don't talk, JC!

00:20:43.175 --> 00:20:44.472
Don't talk, JC!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:51.516
I'm not regretting anything. I'm just glad
that I got to be with you, Sis.

00:20:51.516 --> 00:20:54.987
JC! I'm sorry! I... I...

00:20:54.987 --> 00:20:58.184
Sis... Sis...

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:05.093
No! No, JC! I need you! You said we were
going to be together forever!

00:21:06.598 --> 00:21:11.729
Thank you for telling me everything.

00:21:13.171 --> 00:21:14.536
JC!

00:21:15.307 --> 00:21:16.934
JC!

00:21:17.576 --> 00:21:20.067
No!

00:21:20.746 --> 00:21:26.878
JC! No!

00:21:28.954 --> 00:21:31.390
My only love sprung from my only hate

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.792
Too early seen unknown, and known too late

00:21:33.792 --> 00:21:38.729
Prodigious birth of love it is to me,
that I must love a loathed enemy

00:21:39.131 --> 00:21:41.566
Step by step kimi to deatte

00:21:41.566 --> 00:21:44.136
Toki wo wasurete odoriakashita

00:21:44.136 --> 00:21:46.438
Hoshi ni yadoru sadame wo shirazu ni

00:21:46.438 --> 00:21:48.974
I can't stop falling in love

00:21:48.974 --> 00:21:51.543
Fujitsu na tsuki no kaketa moraru ni

00:21:51.543 --> 00:21:53.879
Terasareru no wa michita desire

00:21:53.879 --> 00:21:56.248
Sadame wo daita boku wa sakenda

00:21:56.248 --> 00:21:58.817
"Wherefore art thou Juliet?"

00:21:58.817 --> 00:22:00.614
Oroka na koi dato

00:22:01.119 --> 00:22:02.950
Azawarau ga iisa

00:22:03.555 --> 00:22:05.523
Subete nagedashite

00:22:06.024 --> 00:22:07.958
Ima sugu ni yuku kara

00:22:08.627 --> 00:22:10.993
Oh, my Juliet...

00:22:11.063 --> 00:22:15.434
Ne kamisama oshiete yo

00:22:15.434 --> 00:22:20.667
Dou sureba negai wa kanau

00:22:21.039 --> 00:22:25.310
Ah! Konnani setsunakute

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:28.211
Yozora ni naku yo

00:22:29.648 --> 00:22:36.355
Ne dare mo ga konna omoi wo daite

00:22:36.355 --> 00:22:39.591
Nemuri ni tsuku no

00:22:39.591 --> 00:22:43.895
Ah! Ima sugu me wo samashite

00:22:43.895 --> 00:22:46.732
Uso dato waratte yo

00:22:46.732 --> 00:22:49.166
Oh, my sweet Juliet

00:22:50.802 --> 00:22:53.271
Nemureru kimi to na mo naki boku wa

00:22:53.271 --> 00:22:54.773
Higeki no ame ni utare

00:22:54.773 --> 00:22:56.434
Say good die

00:23:01.213 --> 00:23:04.910
Why did you hide it from me?
Why did you lie to me?

00:23:05.917 --> 00:23:10.522
In the depths of despair, the
girls continue to fight.

00:23:10.522 --> 00:23:10.956
Episode #1 7
The Truth
In the depths of despair, the
girls continue to fight.

00:23:10.956 --> 00:23:14.517
Episode #1 7
The Truth
